  "Scope": "Move existing atom work charge into its two callers. Single search keeps per-atom InputStep; viability simple atoms use Step under direct \u003C=64-cell row checkpoints; CategorySet/Hybrid keep InputStep and all inner block/range checks. Exact work, bits, storage/loans, original-token/deadline authority; no exemptions/framework/modes. Sixteen equal-result public Count/IsMatch cases, actual canonical LF region46429B ordinary/compiled/live/finite-live/deadline-live; Unicode/wide/nullable/dense NB; single-search and category Count/single-search deadline/live controls; unchanged scalar/literal controls. Four lanes, warm1s/min64, independent60ms calibration, five alternating samples\u003E=20ms. Complete result batches checked after timing. One120s cap, at most one noise confirmation. No package/fullcatalog/unchecked-access campaign.",
